    "description": "Entropy Log",
    "text": "• ENTROPY LOG_\nCYCLE 492.01\nJUST\nNOW\nThe silence is louder tonight. I saw the silhouette\nagain on the ridge, motionless. It feels like the sky is\npressing down on my chest. I'm afraid to sleep.\nCYCLE 491.98\n1 DAY AGO\nFound a strange geometric marking on the\ndoorframe. Not sure if I put it there or if it was\nalways there. The memory is slippery, like oil.\n, CYCLE 485.44\n7 DAYS AGG\nCYCLE 420.00\nUNKNOWN\nDNIN LOSS\nRecord the signal...",
